    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24258" root="صرم" body-key="S">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَرَامٌ</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صِرَامٌ</span></b>  The <i>cutting off of the fruit</i> of
palm-trees: (S, * Msb, and L voce <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَدَادٌ</span>:) and
(L voce <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَذَادٌ</span>) the <i>time,</i> or <i>season, thereof:</i> (S,
L:) or the <i>time,</i> or <i>season, of the ripening of the
fruit</i> of palm-trees. (M, K.) ＝   
